Comment:
 CARLOS (Clinical Assisting Recording Ledger Open Source) is a fork of the
 OpenO EMR project, which is itself a fork of OSCAR McMaster. Copyright
 statements from those projects survive throughout the source tree; they refer
 to the upstream lineage and imply no affiliation with OpenOSP or McMaster
 University.
 .
 The binary packages built from this source embed a large set of Java
 dependencies resolved from Maven Central at build time and shipped inside
 /usr/share/carlos-emr/webapp/. Those artefacts carry their own licences,
 which are recorded in the CycloneDX software bill of materials published with
 each CARLOS release rather than restated here.

