Comment:
 The packaging is licensed AGPL-3.0-only to match the CARLOS deployment
 tooling (carlos-podman), from which several of the configuration decisions
 and their rationale are derived. It is combinable with the GPL-2+ application
 it packages because it is an aggregate, not a derived work: nothing in
 debian/ links against the application.

